 instantly die if you  end up going through this trap over and  over and over again you're gonna learn  you know what you're gonna wanna do and  not do and  for instance it took me a couple of  tries and i wanted to  you know make sure i did this so i  actually  had problems at one point and i said to  myself  oh my god what am i gonna do how how i  can't kill this one guy  and i was talking to lord cognito and  cognito tells me he goes  you do know that you can lower the  difficulty and i was like you can lower  the difficulty  so i ended up lowering the difficulty  and i ended up getting past that  character and that's  how i ended up beating the game which  was not much farther after that  but it ends up being that  you can end up taking your time and  learning a lot  and how beautiful the artwork is and the  combat  is and i will say that the creatures you  end up fighting  are very very ingeniously drawn and  beautifully animated the combat system  is  very very well done i would definitely  say  if you have the time like i said go  download this game and definitely take  it and and you know go into game pass  download it buy it on steam do wherever  you can find it  please go check it out once again this  is from two ton  studios and this is unto the end please  go check them out  thank you very much now remember if you  have to check  anything for gaming make sure you go to  lords of gaming.net where you can find  all your gaming  and hardware news in addition to that  make sure you go and check the iron  lords podcast  on sundays and this is pete also knows  now though  here to give you this video thank you  and have a great day  okay  good  hmm  um  oh  come on  uh  come on  ugh  come on  um  uh hmm  hmm  hmm  okay  oh  foreign  [Music]  you

